zip 条目数与哈希：

```console
$ python -c "import zipfile,hashlib,sys;p=sys.argv[1];z=zipfile.ZipFile(p);print('entries',len(z.namelist()));print('sha256',hashlib.sha256(open(p,'rb').read()).hexdigest())" _build/publish/vicoproplus-moon_textstat-0.1.0.zip
